      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786050000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. FREEZE AND PREVALIDATE BEFORE CREDENTIAL OR NETWORK ACCESS\nprivate workload/trace bytes -> SHA-256 + byte count -> strict parse + representative bodies -> exact fixed-rate/trace schedules and every sweep rung\n-> sizing-derived schedule is the explicit exception: paid sizing derives its rate first\n-> dated quota + READY direct-P2T planning gate -> claim sibling setup artifact before default two-request preflight; fsync each paid row",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. FREEZE AND PREVALIDATE BEFORE CREDENTIAL OR NETWORK ACCESS\nprivate workload/trace bytes -> SHA-256 + byte count -> strict parse + representative bodies -> exact fixed-rate/trace schedules and every sweep rung\n-> sizing-derived schedule is the explicit exception: paid sizing derives its rate first\n-> dated quota + READY direct-P2T planning gate -> claim sibling setup artifact before default two-request preflight; fsync each paid row",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
