      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786050000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. RE-SNAPSHOT THE ENDPOINT AFTER DRAIN, THEN SEAL\nafter every response drains, capture the normalized endpoint-metadata subset again; a subset change invalidates the single-configuration benchmark\n-> promote requests.jsonl -> summary + reports with exactly five decisions; identity/stability/runtime-admission are evidence gates -> manifest v3 -> completion marker last\nmerge/compare require sealed, internally hash-verified evidence; ambiguous attempts withhold cost; forced incompatibilities remain explicitly INVALID",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. RE-SNAPSHOT THE ENDPOINT AFTER DRAIN, THEN SEAL\nafter every response drains, capture the normalized endpoint-metadata subset again; a subset change invalidates the single-configuration benchmark\n-> promote requests.jsonl -> summary + reports with exactly five decisions; identity/stability/runtime-admission are evidence gates -> manifest v3 -> completion marker last\nmerge/compare require sealed, internally hash-verified evidence; ambiguous attempts withhold cost; forced incompatibilities remain explicitly INVALID",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
